<title>CHINA: Burlingame yearly net down 13.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Burlingame yearly net down 13.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.59     vs 11.13</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0	vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    40.66    vs 47.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,077.10 vs 927.65</p>
<p>    Company name		 Burlingame International Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 23-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 16</p>
<p>NOTE - Burlingame is a property investment and securities trading firm.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is five H.K. cents vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
